From 635e8e84693d33ab1a289df9d85b355ab8d6dd2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 17:03:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] sm8850-common: Decommonize the OEM camera layer
 sensorbridge

infiniti uses an older Oplus camera layer generation than macan/macanc/fairlady.
libsensorbridge is part of that layer's ABI closure, so a single shared copy
cannot serve all four devices: the camera provider crashes in
OemLayer::OCommonContext::InitFallbackController during stream configuration.

Declared per device instead, alongside the rest of the closure.
---
 proprietary-files.txt | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/proprietary-files.txt b/proprietary-files.txt
index 4806a92..7b44389 100644
--- a/proprietary-files.txt
+++ b/proprietary-files.txt
@@ -985,7 +985,6 @@ odm/bin/oplus_sensor_fb
 odm/bin/oplus_sensor_logger_daemon
 odm/etc/init/init.oplus.sensor.rc
 odm/lib64/liboplus_service.so
-odm/lib64/libsensorbridge.so
 vendor/bin/hw/vendor.qti.hardware.sensorscalibrate-service
 vendor/bin/init.qcom.sensors.sh
 vendor/bin/qsap_dcfd
